一次却发挥很差，弄得顾浅凝只是疼，实在没有多舒服。顾浅凝想取悦他都从无下手，最后季江然没了心情放开她。背对她躺了一会儿，起身去洗澡。若是以往，顾浅凝会在他出浴室的时候帮他准备好衣服，然后拉着他过去吹头发。可是，顾浅凝对这项业务还不熟练，扯过季江然的衬衣去沙发上坐，想了想，又去他的口袋里把烟翻出来。事实上，她并不是真的顾浅凝。她本来是个代号“终结者”的女特工，子弹打爆脑袋死掉后，灵魂附体，再醒来就成了现在这个顾浅凝。一个堪称破败的豪门千金。顾浅凝沉吟，抓了抓头发，表示很无奈。季江然从浴室里出来，看到她只穿着他的衬衣坐在沙发上抽烟。雪白素衣，像一株梨花，领口袖口都很宽大，被她穿着也显得空空荡荡。抬手间，衬衣领开开合合，纤细漂亮的锁骨也是若隐若现，像翩然欲飞的蝶。袖口滑到胳膊肘儿处，露出一大截手臂，一举手一投足皆是风情。以前顾浅凝从不在人前素面朝天，在床上也是，他讨厌女人的脂粉味，所以从来不亲她。现在的她估计是坏了脑子，连妆都懒得化了。蹙了下眉头，走过去将她手里的烟夺过去掐灭。“你什么时候学会的抽烟？”这样托起顾浅凝的下巴借着灯光打量，肤如凝脂，竟然有点儿好看。顾浅凝轻颌首：“刚学会。”季江然是个霸道的男人，有的时候在床上他还会抽。却不允许她抽，擦拭几下头发凉凉说：“以后别在我面前抽，我讨厌女人抽烟的样子。”他不是在跟她开玩笑，但凡是他说过不喜欢的，她真忤逆去做了，他会将她的手腕扭断。若不是她很有一点儿工夫底子，知道怎么避及，恐怕顾浅凝的这双皓腕早就不复存在了。鬼知道以前他到底跟她说了多少不许，反正她一个也不知道。季江然自己拿衣服去换，抬腕系袖扣的时候想起说：“这个周末，家里一起吃晚餐，听妈的意思你们几个季家未婚妻也得出席。”顾浅凝本来撑着额头打瞌睡，这才望过来，懒洋洋的：“这个消息应该是你大哥通知我才对吧。”事实上，她很佩服顾浅凝这个女人，有本事将关系搞得这样蹩脚，她本来是季家大少季江影的未婚妻，却跟她的小叔子也就是眼前这个季二少保持地下情人关系。白天粉墨登场，锦衣男女各自翩翩，一旦夜幕扯去，又成了另外一副模样。这个草包大小姐，还真就什么都做得出。季江然不会在这里过夜，离开的时候看到顾浅凝躺在沙发上，懒得像只猫似的。睡到半夜方觉出冷气凉了，顾浅凝睁开眼，发现自己还躺在沙发上，去把冷气调小，钻进被子里。明天早上可以睡到自然醒，当个一无事处的草包大小姐就是这样好，衣来伸手饭来张口，除了花钱买奢侈品，即便什么都不会做，也不会引来旁人咂舌，也算她命好。不过没能遂人愿。一早便被门铃声吵醒，响了许久，最后连床头的电话都响了，她才爬起来接。其实早就醒了，以为可以拖得过。没想到这样执着。来的人一定是顾浅凝的妈妈，也知道自己的女儿不争气，所以但凡跟婆家事宜扯上关系的，都要及早的千叮咛万嘱咐。这次又是如此。一进门看到顾浅凝赤足散发，一阵痛心疾首：“江影没跟你说么，这周末要跟季家的人一起用餐，你还不去买几件漂亮的衣服，做一下保养，竟还在家里睡懒觉。”女人体态颇丰，不过穿着举止都很优雅，只是教训起顾浅凝的时候毫不含糊。顾家有三个女儿，大女儿聪慧娴熟，嫁入豪门。老三伶俐机智，年纪尚小。只有她，是三个女儿中最不长脸的，打小就样样本事学不好，脾气还很大。却总算脸蛋长得漂亮，攀上季家这一根高枝。整个上流社会都说，她绝对算走了狗屎运。依仗的，就是顾家信息领域超前，正好可以弥补季家唯一一个薄弱环节。如果不是价码足够大，季江影除非大脑被驴踢了，否则打死也不会看上顾浅凝。顾夫人最怕她不争气，守不住这个金饭碗，所以如覆薄冰，一再提点。“浅凝啊，能嫁给江影那是多大的荣幸，不知多少人羡慕你。所以你才要争点儿气好好表现，别让人整天在背后说三道四。你看看你……”“行了妈，我马上去置办行头，到时候把自己打扮成花蝴蝶一样去赴宴。”顾浅凝没能睡上懒觉，被顾夫人吵得心烦，兀自开车出来。其实她对豪门千金的生活并不陌生，以前当特工的时候只是训练的时候最残酷，后来执行任务，却不是天天打打杀杀，有的时候一个任务做卧底就要很久，非到终结的那一个点，不会轻易大开杀戒。所幸扮过豪门千金，驾驭起来轻车熟路。可是，对购物美容没有兴趣。花为悦已者容，顾浅凝虽然长着一副好皮囊，可是桃花开得不旺盛。由其现在挂上一个季大少未婚妻的头衔，更是让人敬而远之。就是她的这个未婚妻，还对她冷眼相看。就算她把自己打扮成一只凤凰，在他看来也不如山鸡有扮相。甚至视而不见。找了家咖啡馆坐下来，点了咖啡和甜点消磨时光。以前没来过这个城市，中国很大，版图更是辽阔。而她属于特殊军种，专门打击国际犯罪，出入异国的时间比较多。中国这样一个富足繁华的北方城市她甚至没有来过。前几天还在地球仪上看了下。觉得世事真是无常，变化亦是万千，光影交错纵横的刹那，她竟然死而复生，成了另外一个人。有人上来跟她打招呼，眯了下眼认出她：“哎，你不是浅凝，顾浅凝么？”乐了：“你有点儿变样子了，差一点没认出来。”顾浅凝静冷抬眸，看到男子一脸热切，似乎是熟悉的人。不禁指了指自己的脑袋：“不好意思，我这儿出了点问题，哪位？”那人当即恍惚。坐下来说：“听说了，知道你前段时间出了一场意外，有些事情记不清楚了。不过这种事情挺常见，听说可以慢慢恢复。我是你高中同学方信中啊，再想想。”再想也是徒劳，如今在她的大脑皮层里只有一些跟顾浅凝息息相关的事还保留一点儿印象。其余那些陈芝麻烂谷子都是她从别的途径搜集来的。所以，顾浅凝的生身经历她已经不陌生，只是很多时候一些人会不认得。靠到椅背上：“很抱歉，我忘记了。有什么事吗？”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The First Class in the Spring Breeze (001) Rebirth of Gu Qianning Ji Jiangran was in a bad mood. He was a man who had perfected his skills, but this time he performed very poorly. Gu Qianning was only in pain, but not really comfortable. Gu Qianning never tried to please him, and finally Ji Jiangran lost the mood and let her go. He lay with his back to her for a while, then got up to take a shower. If it were in the past, Gu Qianning would help him prepare his clothes when he came out of the bathroom, and then pull him over to dry his hair. However, Gu Qianning was not yet proficient in this business, so she pulled Ji Jiangran's shirt and went to sit on the sofa. After thinking about it, she went into his pocket and took out the cigarette. In fact, she is not really Gu Qianning. She was originally a female agent codenamed \"Terminator\". After she was shot in the head and died, her soul possessed her. When she woke up, she became the Gu Qianning she is now. A daughter of a wealthy family who can be called dilapidated. Gu Qianning groaned and scratched her hair, expressing her helplessness. Ji Jiangran came out of the bathroom and saw her sitting on the sofa wearing only his shirt and smoking. The snow-white plain clothes looked like a pear blossom, and the collar and cuffs were very wide, making it look empty even when she was wearing it. As he raised his hand, the collar of his shirt opened and closed, and his slender and beautiful collarbone was also looming, like a butterfly about to fly. The cuffs slide down to the elbows, exposing a large section of the arms, and every move and gesture is charming. In the past, Gu Qianning had never been naked in front of others, even in bed. He hated the smell of women's makeup, so he never kissed her. Now she is probably out of her mind and doesn't even bother to put on makeup. He frowned, walked over, took the cigarette from her hand and put it out. \"When did you learn to smoke?\" He held up Gu Qianning's chin and looked at it under the light. His skin was like cream, which turned out to be pretty good-looking. Gu Qianning nodded softly: \"I just learned it.\" Ji Jiangran was a domineering man, and sometimes he would twitch in bed. But he didn't allow her to smoke. He wiped her hair a few times and said, \"Don't smoke in front of me in the future. I hate the way women smoke.\" He was not joking with her. If she really disobeyed and did anything he said he didn't like, he would break her wrist. If she hadn't been very skilled in martial arts and knew how to avoid him, I'm afraid Gu Qianning's brilliant wrists would have long since ceased to exist. Who knows how much he told her not to do it before, but she didn't know any of it. Ji Jiangran took his own clothes to change, and when he raised his wrists to tie the cufflinks, he remembered: \"This weekend, we will have dinner together at home. According to Mom's wishes, you Ji family fiancées must also attend.\" Gu Qianning was dozing off with her forehead propped up, but then she looked over and lazily said, \"This news Your eldest brother should have informed me.\" In fact, she admired Gu Qianning for her ability to make the relationship so bad. She was originally the fiancée of Ji Jiangying, the eldest son of the Ji family, but she maintained an underground lover's relationship with her brother-in-law, the second young master Ji in front of her. During the day, the scene is graceful, with men and women in brocade attire dancing gracefully. Once the night falls, it takes on a completely different look. This idiot lady can really do anything. Ji Jiangran would not spend the night here. When he left, he saw Gu Qianning lying on the sofa, as lazy as a cat. After sleeping until midnight, she realized that the air conditioner was getting cold. Gu Qianning opened her eyes and found that she was still lying on the sofa. She went to turn down the air conditioner and got under the quilt. She can sleep until she wakes up naturally tomorrow morning. It is so good to be a useless young lady with nothing to do. She has clothes to put on, food to eat, and mouth to eat. Apart from spending money to buy luxury goods, even if she does nothing and does not attract the attention of others, she is still lucky. But it didn't work out. She was woken up early in the morning by the doorbell, which rang for a long time. Finally, the phone beside her bed rang, and she got up to answer it. In fact, I woke up early and thought I could drag it out. I didn't expect to be so persistent. The person who came must be Gu Qianning's mother. She also knew that her daughter was not up to expectations, so she had to give early warning to anyone who had anything to do with her husband's family. This time again. As soon as she walked in and saw Gu Qianning's bare feet, she felt heartbroken and said, \"Didn't Jiang Ying tell you? I'm going to have dinner with the Ji family this weekend. Why don't you go buy some beautiful clothes and do some maintenance, and you're still sleeping in at home.\" The woman had a good figure, but she dressed and behaved very elegantly. She was unambiguous when she lectured Gu Qianning. The Gu family has three daughters. The eldest daughter is smart and skillful and married into a wealthy family. The third child is smart and witty, but still young. She is the only one who is the least shameless of the three daughters. She has not been able to learn everything since she was a child, and she has a very bad temper. But she finally grew up with a beautiful face and climbed onto the high branch of the Ji family. The whole upper class said that she was absolutely lucky. What they relied on was that the Gu family was advanced in the information field, which could just make up for the Ji family's only weak link. If the price hadn't been big enough, Ji Jiangying wouldn't have taken a fancy to Gu Qianning unless his brain was kicked by a donkey. Mrs. Gu was most afraid that she would fail to live up to her expectations and not be able to keep this golden rice bowl, so she kept mentioning things as if she were covered with thin ice. \"Qian Ning, what an honor it is to be married to Jiang Ying. I don't know how many people envy you. That's why you have to be angry and perform well, and don't let people gossip behind your back all day long. Look at you...\" \"Okay, Mom, I'm going to buy an outfit right away, and then I'll dress up like a butterfly and go to the banquet.\" Gu Qian Ning couldn't sleep in, and was upset by Mrs. Gu's noise, so she drove out alone. In fact, she is no stranger to the life of a rich and powerful daughter. When she was an agent, she was only cruel during training. Later, when she was performing missions, she did not fight and kill every day. Sometimes it would take a long time to be an undercover agent for a mission, and she would not go on a killing spree until the end. Fortunately, I have played the role of a wealthy daughter, so I am familiar with driving. However, I have no interest in shopping for beauty. Flowers please one's appearance. Although Gu Qianning has a good skin, her peach blossoms are not blooming vigorously. The fact that she now holds the title of Ji Dashao's fiancee makes people stay away from her.", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}